# .gitignore matching rules (quick note)
# 	•	File names (no /)
# → match at any directory level by default
# (e.g. *.csv, features.csv)
# 	•	Directory names
# → match only at the current level by default
# → use **/ to match recursively
# (e.g. build/ vs **/build/)